    {
      "Id": "c338e8bc7dee0e13bc7d248234ca3c5b",
      "Text": "WHAT IT DOES: finds the items whose Element > Material contains the text on the left, paints them red and saves them as the selection set \"Concrete elements\". TO CHANGE: edit the text, the property names or the colour, then press Run.",
